WEBVTT

00:07.827 --> 00:09.068
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:09.137 --> 00:10.896
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.965 --> 00:12.413
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.482 --> 00:14.586
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.655 --> 00:17.482
- ♪ Ohh... ♪
- ♪ 哦...♪

00:17.551 --> 00:19.586
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:19.655 --> 00:21.655
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.724 --> 00:23.517
- ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:23.586 --> 00:25.448
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:25.517 --> 00:27.620
- ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:27.689 --> 00:29.620
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:29.689 --> 00:31.620
- ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
- ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:31.689 --> 00:33.586
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.655 --> 00:35.448
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:35.517 --> 00:37.689
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.758 --> 00:39.586
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.655 --> 00:40.965
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:41.034 --> 00:42.793
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.862 --> 00:45.551
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.620 --> 00:47.827
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:47.896 --> 00:49.517
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:52.517 --> 00:55.413
[jaunty nautical music]
[欢快的航海音乐]

00:55.482 --> 01:02.482
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:02.551 --> 01:03.931
- Oh, these are delicious.
- 哦，这些很好吃。

01:04.000 --> 01:05.310
[loud roar]
[all exclaim]
[大声吼叫]
[所有人惊呼]

01:05.379 --> 01:06.551
- What was that?
- 那是什么？

01:06.620 --> 01:08.655
- Think it came
from Krabs' office.
- 认为它来了
来自蟹老板的办公室。

01:08.724 --> 01:10.620
Maybe he's in trouble.
也许他有麻烦了。

01:10.689 --> 01:14.068
- I'll save you, Mr. Krabs!
[grunting]
- 我会救你的，蟹老板！
[咕噜声]

01:14.137 --> 01:16.241
- [growling]
- [咆哮]

01:16.310 --> 01:19.482
- Ooh, Mr. Krabs,
thank Neptune you're okay.
- 哦，蟹老板先生，
感谢海王星，你没事。

01:19.551 --> 01:20.620
[grunts]
[咕哝]

01:20.689 --> 01:21.862
[stomach roaring]
[肚子咕咕叫]

01:21.931 --> 01:23.758
- [grunts]
- [babbles]
- [咕哝]
- [胡言乱语]

01:23.827 --> 01:25.827
Eww, what was that noise?
呃，那是什么声音？

01:25.896 --> 01:27.758
- Huh?
Uh, I didn't hear nothing.
- 啊？
呃，我什么也没听到。

01:27.827 --> 01:29.655
Everything's completely normal.
- Huh.
一切都完全正常。
- 嗯。

01:29.724 --> 01:32.206
- Okay, closing time!
Everyone out!
- 好的，关门时间到了！
大家都出去吧！

01:32.275 --> 01:33.241
[motor clanking]
[马达叮当作响]

01:33.310 --> 01:35.724
[all hollering]
[大家大喊大叫]

01:35.793 --> 01:39.206
[all groaning]
[全都呻吟]

01:39.275 --> 01:40.965
all: Huh?
全体：啊？

01:41.034 --> 01:42.448
- Eh--o-okay...
[laughs nervously]
- 呃--哦-好吧...
[紧张地笑]

01:42.517 --> 01:43.517
See you tomorrow.
明天见。

01:43.586 --> 01:45.034
- But Mr. Krabs,
- 但是蟹老板先生，

01:45.103 --> 01:46.931
Squidward and I
don't want to leave work early.
章鱼哥和我
不想早下班。

01:47.000 --> 01:49.482
Right, Squidward?
- [babbling]
对吧，章鱼哥？
- [胡言乱语]

01:49.551 --> 01:52.896
- Oh, Mr. Krabs,
I could still--
-哦，蟹老板先生，
我仍然可以——

01:52.965 --> 01:55.000
A nickel?
镍币？

01:55.068 --> 01:57.551
And it's the same temperature
as Mr. Krabs.
而且温度都一样
就像蟹老板一样。

01:57.620 --> 01:58.655
Ooh, he's gonna
want this back.
哦，他会
想要这个回来。

01:58.724 --> 02:01.620
[panting]
- [whining]
[气喘吁吁]
- [抱怨]

02:01.689 --> 02:03.620
Ooh.
[goofy groaning]
哦。
[愚蠢的呻吟]

02:03.689 --> 02:07.379
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

02:07.448 --> 02:09.413
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

02:09.482 --> 02:11.655
Follow that boat!
[grunts]
跟着那条船！
[咕哝]

02:11.724 --> 02:14.103
[tires squeal]
[轮胎吱吱声]

02:14.172 --> 02:15.413
[grunts]
[咕哝]

02:15.482 --> 02:16.827
[moans]
[呻吟声]

02:16.896 --> 02:18.896
- Sorry about all those
speed bumps, kid.
- 对所有这些感到抱歉
减速带，孩子。

02:18.965 --> 02:21.965
And the cactus patch
and the demolition derby.
还有仙人掌补丁
和拆除德比。

02:22.034 --> 02:24.344
- "Roast moblem, Orfficer."
- “烤莫莱姆，军官。”

02:24.413 --> 02:25.655
[grunts]
[咕哝]

02:25.724 --> 02:28.620
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

02:28.689 --> 02:30.103
- Mr. Krabs!
- [shrieks]
- 蟹老板！
- [尖叫]

02:30.172 --> 02:32.344
SpongeBob, what are you
doing here, boy-o?
海绵宝宝，你是什么
在这里做什么，男孩？

02:32.413 --> 02:35.310
- [grunts]
I brought your nickel, silly.
- [咕哝]
我给你带来了五分钱，傻瓜。

02:35.379 --> 02:36.689
[bell rings]
[铃声响起]

02:36.758 --> 02:39.068
- What is this place,
and what are you doing here?
- 这是什么地方，
你在这里做什么？

02:39.137 --> 02:40.965
- Nothing, I've never been here
before in my life.
- 没什么，我从来没有来过这里
以前在我的生活中。

02:41.034 --> 02:43.896
- Eugene, got your usual here:
- 尤金，这里有你平常的样子：

02:43.965 --> 02:47.000
one big steaming plate of chum!
一大盘热气腾腾的密友！

02:47.068 --> 02:50.344
Enjoy.
- [belches]
享受。
- [打嗝]

02:50.413 --> 02:52.517
- "Usual"?
"Chum"?
- “通常”？
“密友”？

02:52.586 --> 02:53.965
"Enjoy"?
“享受”？

02:54.034 --> 02:56.344
Oh, I don't understand,
Mr. Krabs.
哦，我不明白，
蟹老板。

02:56.413 --> 02:58.896
- Oh, I suppose
there's no hiding it, boy-o.
- 哦，我想
没有什么可以隐藏的，男孩。

02:58.965 --> 03:02.172
It all started
back in me old Navy days.
一切都开始了
回到我过去的海军时代。

03:02.241 --> 03:05.000
I was a young seaman
on a dangerous mission
我曾是一名年轻的海员
执行危险的任务

03:05.068 --> 03:06.689
deep in enemy territory.
深入敌方领土。

03:06.758 --> 03:08.034
[bell dinging]
[铃声]

03:08.103 --> 03:09.379
- Meal time.
- 吃饭时间。

03:09.448 --> 03:11.827
[overlapping shouting]
[重叠的喊叫]

03:11.896 --> 03:14.379
- Somehow,
in the madness of battle,
- 不知何故，
在疯狂的战斗中，

03:14.448 --> 03:16.310
I became separated
from me crew.
我分开了
来自我的船员。

03:16.379 --> 03:18.000
[yawns, smacks lips]
[打哈欠，咂嘴]

03:18.068 --> 03:20.275
It took hours of fighting
经过数小时的战斗

03:20.344 --> 03:23.206
and sneaking and scraping
to get back to me ship,
以及偷偷摸摸和刮擦
回到我的船，

03:23.275 --> 03:25.310
but by the time I got there,
但当我到达那里时

03:25.379 --> 03:27.413
our supplies
had been decimated.
我们的供应
已被摧毁。

03:27.482 --> 03:28.620
Oh...
哦...

03:28.689 --> 03:32.931
All we had left was chum...
我们只剩下朋友了……

03:33.000 --> 03:35.310
and I hadn't eaten since noon.
而且我从中午就没有吃饭了。

03:35.379 --> 03:37.551
I was starting
to feel peckish.
我刚开始
感到饥饿。

03:37.620 --> 03:39.379
[groaning]
[呻吟]

03:39.448 --> 03:41.793
Hmm? Mm? Mmm!
唔？毫米？嗯！

03:41.862 --> 03:44.275
But, oh, that flavor.
但是，哦，那个味道。

03:44.344 --> 03:46.034
Sweet and gamy
甜美又活泼

03:46.103 --> 03:48.965
with a creamy,
chunky mouthfeel.
带有奶油味，
口感厚实。

03:49.034 --> 03:50.517
Mmm.
嗯。

03:50.586 --> 03:52.931
Oh, I've had a chum monkey
on my back ever since.
哦，我有一只亲密的猴子
从此就在我背上。

03:53.000 --> 03:55.379
[monkey screeches]
[猴子尖叫声]

03:55.448 --> 03:57.896
Been eating the stuff
in secret for years now.
一直在吃东西
多年来一直秘密进行。

03:57.965 --> 04:00.137
Just got a taste for it.
刚刚尝到了滋味。

04:00.206 --> 04:01.896
One of them survival things,
I suppose.
其中之一是生存的东西，
我想。

04:01.965 --> 04:04.137
[grunts]
Mm-mm.
[咕哝]
嗯嗯。

04:04.206 --> 04:06.517
[creature babbles]
- [groans]
[生物的胡言乱语]
- [呻吟]

04:06.586 --> 04:10.103
- Oh, uh, look, SpongeBob,
- 哦，呃，看，海绵宝宝，

04:10.172 --> 04:12.655
I don't want this getting out,
you understand?
我不想让这事传出去
你明白吗？

04:12.724 --> 04:15.034
[laughs]
Especially to Plankton.
[笑]
尤其是对于浮游生物。

04:15.103 --> 04:17.000
So what do you say, huh?
- [groaning]
那你说什么，嗯？
- [呻吟]

04:17.068 --> 04:19.862
- Keep me shame a secret, huh?
- 让我感到羞耻的秘密，好吗？

04:19.931 --> 04:22.620
For old Mr. Krabsy?
- [babbles]
为了老克拉布西先生？
- [胡言乱语]

04:22.689 --> 04:24.310
[laughs]
You got it, Mr. Krabs.
[笑]
你明白了，蟹老板。

04:24.379 --> 04:26.965
My lips are sealed.
- Glad to hear it.
我的嘴唇被封住了。
- 很高兴听到这个消息。

04:27.034 --> 04:28.896
Okay, see you tomorrow.
- [grunts]
好的，明天见。
- [咕哝]

04:28.965 --> 04:31.068
- Sal, I'm feeling
hungry tonight.
- 萨尔，我感觉
今晚饿了。

04:31.137 --> 04:33.448
How's about another plate
of chum?
再来一盘怎么样
密友？

04:33.517 --> 04:35.241
- Oh, sorry, Eugene,
- 哦，对不起，尤金，

04:35.310 --> 04:39.724
that was my last plate
of chum, ever!
那是我的最后一个盘子
密友，永远！

04:39.793 --> 04:42.827
I'm closing the Slop Pail
permanently.
我正在关闭污水桶
永久。

04:42.896 --> 04:44.517
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

04:44.586 --> 04:46.172
- [gasps]
What?
- [喘气]
什么？

04:46.241 --> 04:47.724
[gulps]
[吞咽]

04:47.793 --> 04:51.275
- Yep, I'm moving to Shell City
to make it big in the pictures.
- 是的，我要搬到贝壳城
使其在图片中变大。

04:51.344 --> 04:55.689
Just imagine this mug
on a movie screen
想象一下这个杯子
在电影屏幕上

04:55.758 --> 04:58.482
30 feet wide!
30英尺宽！

04:58.551 --> 05:00.448
[laughs]
[笑]

05:00.517 --> 05:02.862
See you in the movies!
电影里见！

05:02.931 --> 05:05.068
[tires squeal]
[轮胎吱吱声]

05:05.137 --> 05:08.310
- But where
will I get me chum from?
- 但是在哪里
我会得到我的密友吗？

05:08.379 --> 05:11.310
[eagle screams]
[鹰的尖叫声]

05:11.379 --> 05:13.655
- Gosh, Mr. Krabs, I've never
tried to make chum before.
- 天哪，蟹老板，我从来没有
之前尝试过交朋友。

05:13.724 --> 05:15.793
I don't even know
what the ingredients are.
我什至不知道
成分是什么。

05:15.862 --> 05:18.172
- Ugh, well, uh,
- 呃，呃，呃，

05:18.241 --> 05:20.793
it's, uh--it's made from...
它是，呃——它是由…制成的

05:20.862 --> 05:22.413
- Hmm?
- [inaudible whispering]
- 唔？
- [听不见的窃窃私语]

05:22.482 --> 05:24.758
- [groaning]
Eww.
- [呻吟]
呃。

05:24.827 --> 05:27.310
[groans]
[呻吟]

05:27.379 --> 05:30.517
Um, I don't think I can
make that for you, Mr. Krabs,
嗯，我想我不能
为你做这个，蟹老板先生，

05:30.586 --> 05:33.103
but I can make you
some chum-free chum.
但我可以让你
一些没有朋友的朋友。

05:33.172 --> 05:34.758
You won't even be able
to tell the difference.
你甚至无法
来区分。

05:34.827 --> 05:37.000
- I sure hope you're right.
- 我当然希望你是对的。

05:37.068 --> 05:39.379
- Later...
- [humming]
- 后来...
- [嗡嗡声]

05:39.448 --> 05:42.620
Behold: three takes on chum
a la SpongeBob.
看哪：三人对密友的看法
就像海绵宝宝一样。

05:42.689 --> 05:43.827
- Ooh.
- 哦。

05:43.896 --> 05:45.275
- The secret ingredient
in this one?
- 秘密成分
在这个？

05:45.344 --> 05:47.482
Krabby patties.
- [munching]
蟹肉饼。
- [咀嚼]

05:47.551 --> 05:49.724
- Well? Huh?
- 出色地？啊？

05:49.793 --> 05:51.827
- It's delicious!
- 真好吃！

05:51.896 --> 05:53.586
Too delicious!
[grunts]
太好吃了！
[咕哝]

05:53.655 --> 05:55.413
Next.
下一个。

05:55.482 --> 05:57.172
[whimsical music]
[异想天开的音乐]

05:57.241 --> 05:59.448
- To capture the
natural bouquet of the chum,
- 捕捉
密友的天然花束，

05:59.517 --> 06:02.758
I made this batch
entirely from old snail litter.
我做了这批
完全来自旧蜗牛垃圾。

06:02.827 --> 06:04.965
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

06:05.034 --> 06:06.758
[hoarsely]
A little dry.
[沙哑]
有点干。

06:06.827 --> 06:07.862
Next!
下一个！

06:07.931 --> 06:08.965
[plate clatters]
[盘子碰撞声]

06:09.034 --> 06:10.517
- Ooh, I think
you'll like this one.
- 哦，我想
你会喜欢这个的。

06:10.586 --> 06:13.034
I know I do.
[giggling]
我知道我知道。
[咯咯笑]

06:13.103 --> 06:15.448
It's made from wishes
and love.
它是由愿望制成的
和爱。

06:15.517 --> 06:17.793
- [belches]
- [打嗝]

06:17.862 --> 06:20.103
[giggles, grunts]
[咯咯笑，咕哝]

06:20.172 --> 06:22.103
It's too sweet.
它味道太甜了。

06:22.172 --> 06:25.137
Oh, none of these are right,
SpongeBob.
哦，这些都不对，
海绵宝宝。

06:25.206 --> 06:28.103
I think this old chum chewer
我认为这个老咀嚼者

06:28.172 --> 06:31.034
needs some time alone.
需要一些独处的时间。

06:31.103 --> 06:33.310
[whimpering]
[呜咽]

06:33.379 --> 06:36.137
[sobbing]
[stomach screeching]
[抽泣]
[肚子咕咕叫]

06:36.206 --> 06:39.206
Oh, the Chum Bucket's
the only place in town
哦，密友桶
镇上唯一的地方

06:39.275 --> 06:41.206
still selling chum,
还在卖密友，

06:41.275 --> 06:44.551
but I can't go crawling
to Plankton for help.
但我不能去爬行
向 Plankton 寻求帮助。

06:44.620 --> 06:46.379
No, I won't.
不，我不会。

06:46.448 --> 06:49.000
I got too much pride for that.
我为此感到太骄傲了。

06:49.068 --> 06:50.586
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

06:50.655 --> 06:54.034
Oh, come, there's gotta be
some chum in here somewhere!
噢，来吧，一定有
一些密友在这里的某个地方！

06:54.103 --> 06:55.827
- Uh, hello?
- [screams]
- 呃，你好？
- [尖叫]

06:55.896 --> 06:57.379
- Who--who's out there?
- 谁——谁在外面？

06:57.448 --> 06:59.448
- All right, miscreant,
come over here
- 好吧，恶棍，
过来这里

06:59.517 --> 07:03.586
where I can destroy you!
[grunts, groans]
我可以摧毁你！
[咕哝声，呻吟声]

07:03.655 --> 07:05.103
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

07:05.172 --> 07:07.793
- [gasps]
both: Krabs?
- [喘气]
两人：螃蟹？

07:07.862 --> 07:10.655
- What are you doing here?
[grunts]
- 你在这里做什么？
[咕哝]

07:10.724 --> 07:13.965
- Nothing, nothing!
I, uh, lost my shoe!
- 没什么，没什么！
我，呃，鞋子丢了！

07:14.034 --> 07:15.344
See? Found it.
[laughs]
看？找到了。
[笑]

07:15.413 --> 07:17.379
Okay, bye.
[stomach roars]
好的，再见。
[肚子咕咕叫]

07:17.448 --> 07:18.827
- Hold it.
- 握住它。

07:18.896 --> 07:21.103
What's going on with you,
Krabs?
你怎么了，
螃蟹？

07:21.172 --> 07:22.586
Your clothes are a mess
你的衣服乱七八糟

07:22.655 --> 07:25.275
and your stomach's
making strange noises.
和你的胃
发出奇怪的声音。

07:25.344 --> 07:28.000
- What are you talking--I'm...
[stammers]
- 你在说什么--我...
[结巴]

07:28.068 --> 07:29.689
Oh, fine!
哦，好吧！

07:29.758 --> 07:31.793
I'm hooked on chum, okay?
我迷上了密友，好吗？

07:31.862 --> 07:34.137
- Say what?
- 说什么？

07:34.206 --> 07:36.103
- Look at me now!
- 现在看着我！

07:36.172 --> 07:38.000
Digging through garbage
for scraps!
挖掘垃圾
为碎片！

07:38.068 --> 07:41.206
[sobbing]
- [exhales sharply, slurps]
[抽泣]
- [急促地呼气，吸吮]

07:41.275 --> 07:44.827
You actually like chum?
你真的喜欢密友吗？

07:44.896 --> 07:46.931
- How is that possible?
- 这怎么可能？

07:47.000 --> 07:49.827
Nobody likes chum!
It tastes terrible!
没有人喜欢密友！
味道太糟糕了！

07:49.896 --> 07:51.137
- [grunts]
Shh!
- [咕哝]
嘘！

07:51.206 --> 07:53.172
Mute your speaker, Karen.
把你的扬声器静音，凯伦。

07:53.241 --> 07:56.827
This pathetic display
is giving me an idea.
这可悲的表现
给了我一个主意。

07:56.896 --> 07:59.137
All right, Krabs, old buddy,
好吧，蟹蟹，老伙计，

07:59.206 --> 08:03.827
how would you like
a lifetime supply of chum?
你想要怎样
终生供应密友？

08:03.896 --> 08:04.931
- Really?
- 真的吗？

08:05.000 --> 08:07.000
- Sure, for the low, low price
- 当然可以，价格非常低

08:07.068 --> 08:09.482
of the krabby patty
secret formula!
蟹肉饼的
秘密配方！

08:09.551 --> 08:12.448
- [shrieks]
No, no, I can't!
- [尖叫]
不，不，我不能！

08:12.517 --> 08:15.586
Not me formula.
- You sure, Krabs?
不是我的公式。
- 你确定吗，蟹蟹？

08:15.655 --> 08:19.068
Just breathe in
that noxious smell.
只要吸气
那种有毒的气味。

08:19.137 --> 08:21.241
[sniffs]
Mmm, mmm.
[嗅嗅]
嗯，嗯。

08:21.310 --> 08:22.448
[gags]
[笑点]

08:22.517 --> 08:25.586
- [whining]
- [抱怨]

08:25.655 --> 08:28.724
- You know you want it.
- 你知道你想要它。

08:28.793 --> 08:30.896
[laughs evilly]
[邪恶地笑]

08:30.965 --> 08:33.551
- [hooting]
- [鸣叫]

08:33.620 --> 08:37.000
Ah-ha!
[grunts]
啊哈！
[咕哝]

08:37.068 --> 08:38.862
- [grunts]
Ah-ah-ah.
- [咕哝]
啊啊啊。

08:38.931 --> 08:40.724
Not until I have the formula.
直到我有了公式。

08:40.793 --> 08:42.310
- [growls]
Oh, fine!
- [咆哮]
哦，好吧！

08:42.379 --> 08:43.655
I'll be right back.
我马上回来。

08:43.724 --> 08:44.793
[door creaks]
[门吱吱作响]

08:44.862 --> 08:46.827
Ah.
[panting]
啊。
[气喘吁吁]

08:46.896 --> 08:48.758
[grunts]
Huh?
[咕哝]
啊？

08:48.827 --> 08:50.965
- Hi, Mr. Krabs.
- 嗨，蟹老板。

08:51.034 --> 08:53.034
- What are you doing here,
SpongeBob?
- 你在这里做什么，
海绵宝宝？

08:53.103 --> 08:54.793
- Oh, when I can't sleep,
- 哦，当我睡不着的时候，

08:54.862 --> 08:57.241
I come here
to be close to the formula.
我来这里
才能接近公式。

08:57.310 --> 08:59.034
It comforts me.
这让我感到安慰。

08:59.103 --> 09:01.103
- Well, comfort time's
over now!
- 好吧，舒适时间到了
现在结束了！

09:01.172 --> 09:02.965
I'm trading the formula
to Plankton
我正在交易公式
浮游生物

09:03.034 --> 09:05.758
for a lifetime supply of chum.
终生供应密友。

09:05.827 --> 09:06.862
Oh?
哦？

09:06.931 --> 09:08.137
- I can't let you do that,
Mr. Krabs.
- 我不能让你这么做
蟹老板。

09:08.206 --> 09:09.827
You'll thank me for this later.
稍后你会为此感谢我的。

09:09.896 --> 09:11.344
Okay.
[grunting]
好的。
[咕噜声]

09:11.413 --> 09:14.241
- [growls]
- Gotta get a better grip.
- [咆哮]
- 必须获得更好的抓地力。

09:14.310 --> 09:16.275
- [sighs]
- Okay, okay.
- [叹气]
- 好吧，好吧。

09:16.344 --> 09:18.241
- Plankton, where are you?
- 浮游生物，你在哪里？

09:18.310 --> 09:21.517
I got the formula!
I'm here to collect me chum!
我得到了公式！
我是来接我的朋友的！

09:21.586 --> 09:23.862
- I'm up here, Krabs!
- 我在这儿，蟹蟹！

09:23.931 --> 09:25.275
- [sighs]
- Whoa!
- [叹气]
- 哇！

09:25.344 --> 09:27.172
- Oh...
- [grunts]
- 哦...
- [咕哝]

09:27.241 --> 09:29.241
- Whoo-hoo!
Just look at that chum!
- 呼呼！
看看那个朋友！

09:29.310 --> 09:32.137
And it's for me!
[laughing]
这是给我的！
[笑]

09:32.206 --> 09:35.517
- Oh, I'm so sorry, Krabs.
- 哦，我很抱歉，蟹老板。

09:35.586 --> 09:38.482
You foiled too many of my plans
over the years
你挫败了我太多的计划
多年来

09:38.551 --> 09:41.137
for me not to
double-cross you now.
对我来说不
现在就出卖你。

09:41.206 --> 09:44.620
This time,
I have the upper hand!
这一次，
我占了上风！

09:44.689 --> 09:46.068
[both grunt]
[两人咕哝]

09:46.137 --> 09:48.137
[grunts, laughs]
[咕哝，大笑]

09:48.206 --> 09:50.000
Get it?
"Upper hand"?
得到它？
“占上风”？

09:50.068 --> 09:53.965
[laughs]
I win and you get nothing!
[笑]
我赢了，你什么也得不到！

09:54.034 --> 09:55.862
- [grunts, hollers]
- [咕哝声、叫喊声]

09:55.931 --> 09:58.827
[both hollering, grunting]
[两人都大喊大叫，咕哝着]

09:58.896 --> 10:01.344
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

10:01.413 --> 10:03.793
[all gasp]
all: No!
[全都喘气]
全体：不！

10:03.862 --> 10:05.448
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

10:05.517 --> 10:06.965
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

10:07.034 --> 10:10.620
- You and SpongeBrain
can see yourselves out, Krabs.
- 你和 SpongeBrain
蟹蟹们，你们可以看看自己。

10:10.689 --> 10:12.758
Ta-ta!
[laughs]
塔塔！
[笑]

10:12.827 --> 10:15.172
Alley-oop!
空中接力！

10:15.241 --> 10:18.000
- Oh, no, this is terrible!
- 哦，不，这太可怕了！

10:18.068 --> 10:20.620
Oh, my formula's gone!
哦，我的公式不见了！

10:20.689 --> 10:22.482
I'm ruined!
我毁了！

10:22.551 --> 10:24.103
And hungry!
而且饿了！

10:24.172 --> 10:26.689
- Wait, Mr. Krabs!
Plankton is tiny.
- 等等，蟹老板！
浮游生物很小。

10:26.758 --> 10:30.172
It'll take him forever
to swim through that chum.
这将需要他永远
游过那个密友。

10:30.241 --> 10:32.275
You can get to the formula
before him,
你可以得到公式
在他面前，

10:32.344 --> 10:34.275
but you're gonna have
to eat like the wind.
但你将会有
吃得像风一样。

10:34.344 --> 10:36.137
- You're right, boy-o!
- 你是对的，孩子！

10:36.206 --> 10:38.482
I can do this!
我可以做到这一点！

10:38.551 --> 10:40.586
- Whoo!
- 呼！

10:40.655 --> 10:44.103
- [munching]
- [咀嚼]

10:44.172 --> 10:46.103
- Go, Mr. Krabs, go!
- [slurping]
- 走吧，蟹老板，走吧！
- [发出声音]

10:46.172 --> 10:49.000
- Whoo!
No, don't fill up on bread!
- 呼！
不，不要吃面包填饱肚子！

10:49.068 --> 10:52.034
The chum!
Eat the chum!
密友！
吃密友吧！

10:52.103 --> 10:55.241
- Right!
[sucking]
- 正确的！
[吸吮]

10:55.310 --> 10:57.827
- Hmm.
[babbles]
- 唔。
[胡言乱语]

10:57.896 --> 11:00.724
- Oh...
- 哦...

11:00.793 --> 11:02.724
[belches]
[打嗝]

11:02.793 --> 11:04.344
- Mr. Krabs, you did it!
- 蟹老板，你做到了！

11:04.413 --> 11:06.655
You saved the secret formula.
您保存了秘密配方。

11:06.724 --> 11:11.310
- Oh, and I think I killed
me taste for chum too.
- 哦，我想我杀了
我也喜欢密友。

11:11.379 --> 11:14.551
See?
[groans]
看？
[呻吟]

11:14.620 --> 11:17.000
I'll never touch another bite
of the stuff
我再也不会碰任何一口
的东西

11:17.068 --> 11:19.413
as long as I live.
只要我还活着。

11:19.482 --> 11:22.931
Oh...
- Hey, where'd Plankton go?
哦...
- 嘿，浮游生物去哪儿了？

11:23.000 --> 11:24.379
- Hold still.
- 保持不动。

11:24.448 --> 11:26.827
This isn't the first time
this has happened.
这不是第一次
这已经发生了。

11:26.896 --> 11:28.724
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

11:28.793 --> 11:31.586
- Hmm, could take him a while
to get out.
- 嗯，可能需要他一段时间
出去。

11:31.655 --> 11:33.241
- What should we do
while we wait?
- 我们应该做什么
当我们等待的时候？

11:33.310 --> 11:35.827
- [whines]
- [哀嚎]

11:35.896 --> 11:40.344
- You'll never get away
with this, Dr. Kelpington!
- 你永远不会逃脱
有了这个，凯尔平顿博士！

11:40.413 --> 11:42.206
- Mm, could you pass
the popcorn?
- 嗯，你能过去吗
爆米花？

11:42.275 --> 11:44.344
- [grunts, screeches]
- [咕哝声，尖叫声]

11:44.413 --> 11:46.620
- Get me out of here!
- 带我离开这里！

11:46.689 --> 11:51.862
- Shh.
- 嘘。

11:51.931 --> 11:59.034
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

♪ ♪